    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4670" root="ثم" body-key="v">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثَمُومٌ</span></b>  A sheep (T, S, M, K) or goat (S, M, K)
<i>that pulls,</i> or <i>plucks, up,</i> or <i>out, with her mouth,</i>
(T, S, M, K,) <i>a thing,</i> (T, M,) or <i>a plant:</i> (S,
K:) and <i>that eats</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثُمَام</span>. (M, TA.)

